new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..5b4335195a43322966dd0f529f2283efd907ab59
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/consistent-configuration-authentication.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Add password authentication policy controls to shop settings and respect the active policy on login and password recovery pages. Handle failed or incomplete authentication responses without redirecting as if authentication succeeded, and remove callback credentials from browser history.
+
+Expose channel stock availability strategy and automatic checkout completion configuration, including delay and creation-time cutoff. Saving these settings does not report that background processing has completed.
+
+Preserve unsaved configuration edits across refetches, reject duplicate submissions while a request is pending, and report incomplete configuration or warehouse reorder results as failures rather than successful saves.
